WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.380
- There's one part of the phone call

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.560
between President Trump
and Brad Raffensperger

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.520
that I find particularly worrying

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.010
apart from the whole potential
election interference thing,

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:08.940
and that's the,

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.480
Secretary of State Raffensperger said

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.110
that he never planned
on releasing that tape

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.700
unless President Trump
disclosed it and lied about it,

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.470
which the President did via tweet.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.800
- It was a private conversation
as far as I was concerned.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.740
He broke privacy when he put out a tweet.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.700
- That means that apart

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.810
from the whole criminality
of the whole call.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:28.110
If the President hadn't
opened his big mouth,

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.190
we might not have ever
learned about this call,

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:31.890
which might be criminal, it might not be,

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.030
but in any event, it's extremely worrying.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:36.430
Raffensperger was on notice
because of four years

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:37.310
of the Trump Presidency

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:39.700
and the fact that he
received 18 attempted calls

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:40.533
from the President.

00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:41.840
He knew that something was up.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.980
But the really worrying
part is that President Trump

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:46.800
has probably made dozens
or hundreds of such calls

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.010
that we'll never hear about

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:50.540
because they were either never
recorded or never released.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.080
If you'd like to learn if the call itself

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.370
was criminal or not, check
out the whole 20 minute video

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.650
that I did on whether
the call was illegal.

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:59.133
And as always, I'll see you in court.

